a></h3></div><div class="mt-2 text-black/80 text-sm flex-1">The SEC will convene a Sept. 17 roundtable on 24-hour U.S. equity trading as 24 Exchange already operates toward 23-hour weekday sessions.</div></div></article></div><div class="col-span-4"><article class="border rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:cursor-pointer flex flex-col hover:bg-muted/50 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg group h-full"><div class="relative w-full aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden rounded-t-lg"><div class="object-cover w-full h-full"><picture><img alt="Overnight clearing operations floor with one desk lamp on and clocks on the far wall." loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="33vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fdtcc-nscc-24x5-overnight-ops-1.webp%3F2026-09-16T21%3A28%3A15.116Z&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fdtcc-nscc-24x5-overnight-ops-1.webp%3F2026-09-16T21%3A28%3A15.116Z&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fdtcc-nscc-24x5-overnight-ops-1.webp%3F2026-09-16T21%3A28%3A15.116Z&amp;w=512&amp;q=75 512w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fdtcc-nscc-24x5-overnight-ops-1.webp%3F2026-09-16T21%3A28%3A15.116Z&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fdtcc-nscc-24x5-overnight-ops-1.webp%3F2026-09-16T21%3A28%3A15.116Z&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fdtcc-nscc-24x5-overnight-ops-1.webp%3F2026-09-16T21%3A28%3A15.116Z&amp;w=1024&amp;q=75 1024w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fdtcc-nscc-24x5-overnight-ops-1.webp%3F2026-09-16T21%3A28%3A15.116Z&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fdtcc-nscc-24x5-overnight-ops-1.webp%3F2026-09-16T21%3A28%3A15.116Z&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fapi%2Fmedia%2Ffile%2Fdtcc-nscc-24x5-overnight-ops-1.webp%3F2026-09-